    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p>Updates regarding the Game</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>The <strong>Upper Downer Complex</strong> is a game about you! You're trapped inside your own dream and your goal is to <strong>wake up</strong>! The problem is... you think you have time.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Levels</h2>Explore over 30 unique levels based upon Dreams and Liminal Spaces<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766150/extras/af2b3d86d8a86c09ef153d83cc015654.avif?t=1752349941\" width=600 height=228 /></span><br><br>The Story unfolds around you; the truth is hidden beneath all the layers of dream worlds, while you try to avoid HIM. Jump between Dream Worlds and discover familiar Places!.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766150/extras/9349cdf0ea505410cbd8458f95dce605.avif?t=1752349941\" width=600 height=228 /></span><br><br>The Dreamword is the Key to the truth. Navigate yourself through the Levels and get a different play through every time!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766150/extras/85abc0cf2aeaedf3b728b1d037361b9c.avif?t=1752349941\" width=600 height=228 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "The <strong>Upper Downer Complex</strong> is a game about you! You're trapped inside your own dream and your goal is to <strong>wake up</strong>! The problem is... you think you have time.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Levels</h2>Explore over 30 unique levels based upon Dreams and Liminal Spaces<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766150/extras/af2b3d86d8a86c09ef153d83cc015654.avif?t=1752349941\" width=600 height=228 /></span><br><br>The Story unfolds around you; the truth is hidden beneath all the layers of dream worlds, while you try to avoid HIM. Jump between Dream Worlds and discover familiar Places!.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766150/extras/9349cdf0ea505410cbd8458f95dce605.avif?t=1752349941\" width=600 height=228 /></span><br><br>The Dreamword is the Key to the truth. Navigate yourself through the Levels and get a different play through every time!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766150/extras/85abc0cf2aeaedf3b728b1d037361b9c.avif?t=1752349941\" width=600 height=228 /></span>",
